#: ../../quick-reference.rst:111
msgid ""
"``\"http\": {\"surface\": \"off\"}`` gives a load balancer with no "
"firewall. TCP and UDP frontends never use the firewall."
msgstr ""
"``\"http\": {\"surface\": \"off\"}`` ergibt einen Load Balancer ohne "
"Firewall. TCP- und UDP-Frontends verwenden die Firewall nie."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:113
msgid ""
"The operator console of the edge (SID 0031) needs a ``console`` section "
"in the file:"
msgstr ""
"Die Betreiberkonsole des Edge (SID 0031) braucht einen Abschnitt "
"``console`` in der Datei:"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:115
msgid ""
"# console: { listen: \"127.0.0.1:9443\", data_dir: \"/var/lib/sibuna\", "
"node: 1 }\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir /var/lib/sibuna    # once, while the "
"daemon is stopped\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv                         # then open "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/ and the page Edge\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge          # the "
"node, its frontends and its pools\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/fleet    # one "
"row for each member\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" -H \"X-Console-CSRF: $CSRF\" -H \"Origin: "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n"
"     -d '{\"line\":\"set server app/a state drain\"}' "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/command"
msgstr ""
"# console: { listen: \"127.0.0.1:9443\", data_dir: \"/var/lib/sibuna\", "
"node: 1 }\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir /var/lib/sibuna    # einmal, während "
"der Daemon angehalten ist\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv                         # dann "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/ und die Seite Edge öffnen\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge          # der "
"Knoten, seine Frontends und seine Pools\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/fleet    # "
"eine Zeile für jedes Mitglied\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" -H \"X-Console-CSRF: $CSRF\" -H \"Origin: "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n"
"     -d '{\"line\":\"set server app/a state drain\"}' "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/command"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:125
msgid ""
"The command route takes ``set server ... state|weight``, ``add server``, "
"``del server``, ``del ban``, ``reload cluster`` and ``show "
"servers|cluster|certs|ca``, each with the checks of ``sibuna ctl``. It "
"needs the role of an operator."
msgstr ""
"Die Befehlsroute nimmt ``set server ... state|weight``, ``add server``, "
"``del server``, ``del ban``, ``reload cluster`` und ``show "
"servers|cluster|certs|ca`` an, jeweils mit den Prüfungen von ``sibuna "
"ctl``. Sie braucht die Rolle eines Betreibers."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:127
msgid ""
"Admission options of a frontend (SID 0032): ``\"defer_accept\": \"5s\"`` "
"and ``\"backlog\": 4096`` on ``tcp`` and ``http``; ``\"inspect_bytes\"`` "
"and ``\"inspect_fallback\": {\"absent\": {\"action\": \"deny\"}}`` beside "
"``tcp_inspect``; ``\"udp_inspect\": \"quic\"`` on ``udp``. All are off by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Zulassungsoptionen eines Frontends (SID 0032): ``\"defer_accept\": "
"\"5s\"`` und ``\"backlog\": 4096`` auf ``tcp`` und ``http``; "
"``\"inspect_bytes\"`` und ``\"inspect_fallback\": {\"absent\": "
"{\"action\": \"deny\"}}`` neben ``tcp_inspect``; ``\"udp_inspect\": "
"\"quic\"`` auf ``udp``. Alle sind standardmäßig aus."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:129
msgid "Console (opt-in preview)"
msgstr "Konsole (optionale Vorschau)"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:132
msgid ""
"# Initialize while the daemon is stopped, then start the console\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir ./data\n"
"sibuna --data-dir ./data --console 127.0.0.1:19446"
msgstr ""
"# Bei gestopptem Daemon initialisieren, dann die Konsole starten\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir ./data\n"
"sibuna --data-dir ./data --console 127.0.0.1:19446"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:138
msgid ""
"Open ``http://127.0.0.1:19446/console/`` and replace the temporary "
"password. Add ``--console-location 1.3521,103.8198`` to place the node on "
"the globe. Remote access requires an HTTPS proxy, an explicit origin and "
"trusted-proxy CIDRs; follow Part XI. SID 0007 is Committed. The console "
"passes its browser workflows in headless Chromium (SID 0010, criterion "
"5); its formal performance isolation gate remains open (Part X)."
msgstr ""
"``http://127.0.0.1:19446/console/`` öffnen und das temporäre Passwort "
"ersetzen. Mit ``--console-location 1.3521,103.8198`` wird der Knoten auf "
"dem Globus platziert. Fernzugriff erfordert einen HTTPS-Proxy, einen "
"ausdrücklichen Origin und CIDRs vertrauenswürdiger Proxys; dazu Teil XI "
"folgen. SID 0007 hat den Status Committed. Die Konsole besteht ihre "
"Browser-Workflows in Headless Chromium (SID 0010, Kriterium 5); ihr "
"formales Isolationskriterium für die Leistung ist noch offen (Teil X)."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:140
msgid "Flags That Matter First"
msgstr "Die wichtigsten Optionen"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:147
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:148
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Standard"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:149 ../../quick-reference.rst:318
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Bedeutung"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:150
msgid "``-d, --difficulty``"
msgstr "``-d, --difficulty``"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:151 ../../quick-reference.rst:157
msgid "16"
msgstr "16"

